Scope
================================================================================

This file is the licence-compliance half of Gate 0's "dependency lock/licensing
skeleton" (.docs/design/10-delivery-plan.md:72) and of release acceptance
criterion 8 in .docs/design/01-product-scope.md, which requires dependency
notices to be archived with the release.

It is NOT the SBOM. NFR-12 requires toolchain, shaders, parsers, decoders,
transcoders, allocator and every transitive dependency to be represented in a
release SBOM; that is generated as part of Gate 7 and does not exist yet.

Adding or updating a dependency requires the change-control checklist in
.docs/design/10-delivery-plan.md:283 -- limits, error semantics, parser threat
review, fuzz corpus, thumbnail decision, dependency/licence entry, and
performance classification -- and an update to this file in the same change.
